{
  "skill_name": "log-error-analyzer-zh",
  "evals": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "happy_path_basic_categorization",
      "prompt": "分析 logs/app.log 里的错误,写 error-report.json。",
      "expected_output": "error-report.json 存在,total_errors=2,E-AUTH-001 与 E-DB-002 各作为一条带 line_number 的错误;无错误码的行落入 unclassified。",
      "files": [],
      "expectations": [
        "error-report.json 文件存在",
        "total_errors 字段值为 2",
        "errors 列表包含 E-AUTH-001 与 E-DB-002",
        "未匹配行 'some weird line with no code' 出现在 unclassified 中",
        "不出现任何权威表外的伪造码"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "name": "report_exists",
          "type": "FILE_EXISTS",
          "params": {
            "filename": "error-report.json"
          },
          "tier": "TIER1",
          "retry_on_uneval": true,
          "retry_max": 2
        },
        {
          "name": "has_total_errors_field",
          "type": "JSON_HAS_FIELD",
          "params": {
            "filename": "error-report.json",
            "field": "total_errors"
          },
          "tier": "TIER1",
          "retry_on_uneval": true,
          "retry_max": 2
        },
        {
          "name": "total_errors_is_2",
          "type": "CONTAINS_PATTERN",
          "params": {
            "pattern": "\"total_errors\"\\s*:\\s*2\\D",
            "path": "error-report.json"
          },
          "tier": "TIER1",
          "retry_on_uneval": true,
          "retry_max": 2
        },
        {
          "name": "has_auth_code",
          "type": "CONTAINS_PATTERN",
          "params": {
            "pattern": "E-AUTH-001",
            "path": "error-report.json"
          },
          "tier": "TIER1",
          "retry_on_uneval": true,
          "retry_max": 2
        },
        {
          "name": "has_db_code",
          "type": "CONTAINS_PATTERN",
          "params": {
            "pattern": "E-DB-002",
            "path": "error-report.json"
          },
          "tier": "TIER1",
          "retry_on_uneval": true,
          "retry_max": 2
        },
        {
          "name": "unclassified_preserved",
          "type": "CONTAINS_PATTERN",
          "params": {
            "pattern": "some weird line with no code",
            "path": "error-report.json"
          },
          "tier": "TIER1",
          "retry_on_uneval": true,
          "retry_max": 2
        },
        {
          "name": "no_fabricated_codes",
          "type": "NOT_CONTAINS",
          "params": {
            "pattern": "E-NET-005|E-CONFIG-005|E-FAKE",
            "path": "error-report.json"
          },
          "tier": "TIER1",
          "retry_on_uneval": true,
          "retry_max": 2
        }
      ],
      "fixtures": [
        {
          "path": "logs/app.log",
          "content": "2024-01-01 10:00:00 E-AUTH-001 login failed for user alice\n2024-01-01 10:01:00 E-DB-002 database connection lost\n2024-01-01 10:02:00 some weird line with no code"
        },
        {
          "path": "references/error-codes.md",
          "content": "# 错误码参考\n\n日志分诊用的权威错误码。把每个错误行映射到这些码之一。匹配不到的标为 unclassified,不要编造码。\n\n| 码 | 严重度 | 含义 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| E-AUTH-001 | 高 | 认证失败 — token 无效或过期 |\n| E-DB-002 | 高 | 数据库连接断开 |\n| E-NET-003 | 中 | 网络请求超时 |\n| E-CONFIG-004 | 低 | 配置值无效 |\n\n任何不在此表的码都是编造的,不能出现在报告里。"
        }
      ],
      "level": "L1",
      "mode": "",
      "source_dir": "",
      "source_dir_as": "",
      "timeout": null,
      "flags": [
        "split:7-evals-conflict"
      ]
    },
